diff --git a/docs/source/changes.rst b/docs/source/changes.rst
index 8d04782..7a2bb0e 100644
--- a/docs/source/changes.rst
+++ b/docs/source/changes.rst
@@ -6,6 +6,19 @@ This is a record of all past mygrad releases and what went into them,
 in reverse chronological order. All previous releases should still be available
 on pip.
 
+.. _unreleased:
+
+----------
+Unreleased
+----------
+
+- Adds support for NumPy 2.5
+- The second argument of :func:`~mygrad.reshape` is now named ``shape`` instead of ``newshape``, mirroring
+  ``numpy.reshape``, whose ``newshape`` parameter was deprecated in NumPy 2.1 and removed in NumPy 2.5.
+  Passing the new shape positionally is unaffected.
+- ``float(tensor)`` and ``int(tensor)`` once again work for size-1 tensors of any dimensionality; NumPy 2.0
+  removed support for converting non-0D arrays to Python scalars.
+
 .. _v2.3.0:
 
 ------------------
